# Normalize line endings in the repo to LF, but check out Windows-only
# scripts with CRLF so they still run correctly in cmd.exe. Without this,
# every file Android Studio touches on Windows shows as 100% changed in
# git diff/commit (a line-ending swap, not a real content change) — that's
# what was happening with gradlew.bat and the .idea/*.xml files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tflite binary
